{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garrett, the Master Thief, steps out of the shadows into the City. In this treacherous place, where the Baron\u2019s Watch spreads a rising tide of fear and oppression, his skills are the only things he can trust. Even the most cautious citizens and their best-guarded possessions are not safe from his reach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an uprising emerges, Garrett finds himself entangled in growing layers of conflict. Lead by Orion, the voice of the people, the tyrannized citizens will do everything they can to claim back the City from the Baron\u2019s grasp.  The revolution is inevitable. If Garrett doesn\u2019t get involved, the streets will run red with blood and the City will tear itself apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garrett never paid the price for anything\u2026 until now.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU ARE GARRETT, THE MASTER THIEF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/82dee498a06081f2be39e0232309871e.poster.avif?t=1755542243\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/82dee498a06081f2be39e0232309871e.webm?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/82dee498a06081f2be39e0232309871e.mp4?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step into the silent shoes of Garrett, a dark and lonely thief with an unrivalled set of skills. The most challenging heists, the most inaccessible loots, the best kept secrets: nothing is out of your reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CITY: YOURS FOR THE TAKING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/cd8ec4a3feeadc5adcde53b64ba18842.poster.avif?t=1755542243\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/cd8ec4a3feeadc5adcde53b64ba18842.webm?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/cd8ec4a3feeadc5adcde53b64ba18842.mp4?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore the sick and troubled City, from its shady back alleys to the heights of its rooftops.  Sneak into  rich houses, Infiltrate the best-guarded mansions and lurk in every dark corner\u2026 unnoticed and unsanctioned. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR APPROACH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/2d07e504a7f058fb45a451db09244e03.poster.avif?t=1755542243\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/2d07e504a7f058fb45a451db09244e03.webm?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/2d07e504a7f058fb45a451db09244e03.mp4?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leverage Garrett\u2019s arsenal to take down guards with your blackjack, shoot one of your many arrow types or use your newly acquired focus abilities to manipulate the environment and outsmart your enemies. What kind of master thief will you be?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNPRECEDENTED IMMERSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/7976c82490a511479397b70d26df1bc0.poster.avif?t=1755542243\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/7976c82490a511479397b70d26df1bc0.webm?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/7976c82490a511479397b70d26df1bc0.mp4?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become one with the world thanks to  a truly tactile and visceral first-person experience. Thief delivers unprecedented immersion through sights, sounds and artificial intelligence.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Obsessive Compulsive ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/239160/dfa9111c57c76c47b46db5770ad99a66a1b1c7aa.jpg"},{"name":"Sleight of Hand ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/239160/9d3859cbf7c1ae1af9fdba04bb2351796a9e7fd2.jpg"},{"name":"Quickly Pick a Lucky Lock ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/239160/7af57b105516d443eba523c9217f99735a0c534b.jpg"},{"name":"Something to Prove ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/239160/f11604706e3c4e77a80af3fb16cc00e14d4de584.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Archer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/239160/f040a08c870274aae1f8c83d1bfa8b96e1f0c328.jpg"},{"name":"Legend in Leather ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/239160/6463220ca8c0761a29accfecca63a4762c161841.jpg"},{"name":"Mint Condition ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/239160/6807d89f607d6c5319f9b17cb3ebc514d99a205f.jpg"},{"name":"Focus on the Tasks at Hand ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/239160/3aaae4fc78da0