they can to claim back the City from the Baron\u2019s grasp.  The revolution is inevitable. If Garrett doesn\u2019t get involved, the streets will run red with blood and the City will tear itself apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garrett never paid the price for anything\u2026 until now.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU ARE GARRETT, THE MASTER THIEF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/82dee498a06081f2be39e0232309871e.poster.avif?t=1755542243\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/82dee498a06081f2be39e0232309871e.webm?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/82dee498a06081f2be39e0232309871e.mp4?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step into the silent shoes of Garrett, a dark and lonely thief with an unrivalled set of skills. The most challenging heists, the most inaccessible loots, the best kept secrets: nothing is out of your reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CITY: YOURS FOR THE TAKING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/cd8ec4a3feeadc5adcde53b64ba18842.poster.avif?t=1755542243\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/cd8ec4a3feeadc5adcde53b64ba18842.webm?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/cd8ec4a3feeadc5adcde53b64ba18842.mp4?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore the sick and troubled City, from its shady back alleys to the heights of its rooftops.  Sneak into  rich houses, Infiltrate the best-guarded mansions and lurk in every dark corner\u2026 unnoticed and unsanctioned. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR APPROACH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/2d07e504a7f058fb45a451db09244e03.poster.avif?t=1755542243\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/2d07e504a7f058fb45a451db09244e03.webm?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/2d07e504a7f058fb45a451db09244e03.mp4?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leverage Garrett\u2019s arsenal to take down guards with your blackjack, shoot one of your many arrow types or use your newly acquired focus abilities to manipulate the environment and outsmart your enemies. What kind of master thief will you be?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNPRECEDENTED IMMERSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/7976c82490a511479397b70d26df1bc0.poster.avif?t=1755542243\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/7976c82490a511479397b70d26df1bc0.webm?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/extras/7976c82490a511479397b70d26df1bc0.mp4?t=1755542243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become one with the world thanks to  a truly tactile and visceral first-person experience. Thief delivers unprecedented immersion through sights, sounds and artificial intelligence.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Eidos-Montr\u00e9al","Feral Interactive (Mac)"],"dlc":[259900,265190,265191,265192,265193],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/header.jpg?t=1755542243","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Thief \u00a9 2013 Eidos Interactive Corporation, group of companies. Developed by Eidos-Montr\u00e9al. All rights reserved. <br />\r\nTHIEF, the THIEF logo, EIDOS-MONTR\u00c9AL and the EIDOS logo are trademarks of the Eidos Interactive Corporation group of companies.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB Nvidia 650, 1GB AMD 5750, 1.5GB Intel Iris Pro or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pre 10.13 Users:</h2> <strong>Players using a version of OS X before 10.13 can access a compatible version of the game via the Beta tab in the game\u2019s properties window. Select the \u2018mac_support' branch for a version that is compatible with 10.9.1 up to 10.12.6.</strong></li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":70,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/thief?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/239160/1002691519/7e0413f1d74f95ae93e0d896119c005823a77673/1755178615/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755181959","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/239160/1002691519/7e0413f1d74f95ae93e0d896119c005823a77673/1755178615/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755181959","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.a